---
import Layout from '../layouts/Layout.astro';
import CodeBlock from '../components/CodeBlock.astro';

const migrate = `import { getCallingCode, getDialCode, isValidCallingCode } from 'country-kit';

getCallingCode('AI');        // 1.x: '+1264'  →  2.0: '+1'
getDialCode('AI');           // '+1264'  phone-input prefix
isValidCallingCode('+1264'); // 1.x: true if you stored NPAs  →  2.0: false
isValidCallingCode('+1');    // true`;
---

<Layout
  title="Changelog"
  description="country-kit version history: npm 1.0.0 to 1.1.0, git 2.0.0 E.164 calling codes, and docs-site tooling upgrades."
>
  <section class="container min-w-0 max-w-3xl py-10">
    <h1 class="text-3xl font-semibold tracking-tight">Changelog</h1>
    <p class="mt-3 text-[var(--muted)]">
      npm has 1.0.0 through 1.1.0. This repo is 2.0.0 and is not published yet. Entries come from git and those npm versions. Full text lives in
      <a class="underline underline-offset-4" href="https://github.com/thevipinmishra/country-kit/blob/main/packages/country-kit/CHANGELOG.md">packages/country-kit/CHANGELOG.md</a>.
    </p>

    <h2 class="mt-12 text-xl font-semibold">Docs site and tooling</h2>
    <p class="mt-3 text-[var(--muted)]">
      These bumps are in this workspace. They do not change the country-kit public API.
    </p>
    <ul class="mt-4 list-disc space-y-2 pl-5 text-[var(--muted)]">
      <li>Docs app: Astro 7, Tailwind 4, React 19. Building or previewing docs needs Node 22.12 or newer (Astro 7).</li>
      <li>Package devDependencies: Vitest 4, Rslib 0.23, Biome 2, TypeScript 5.9. Runtime <code class="font-mono text-sm text-[var(--ink)]">engines.node</code> for country-kit stays <code class="font-mono text-sm text-[var(--ink)]">&gt;=18</code>.</li>
    </ul>

    <h2 class="mt-12 text-xl font-semibold">2.0.0</h2>
    <p class="mt-3 text-[var(--muted)]">
      Unreleased on npm. Git 2026-08-29. Generated ISO 3166-1 / UN M49 dataset, ITU-T E.164 calling codes, TLD and currency lookups, Wikipedia SVG flags.
    </p>

    <h3 class="mt-8 text-base font-semibold">Who 2.0 breaks</h3>
    <ul class="mt-3 list-disc space-y-2 pl-5 text-[var(--muted)]">
      <li>Phone UIs that treated <code class="font-mono text-sm text-[var(--ink)]">getCallingCode('AI')</code> as <code class="font-mono text-sm text-[var(--ink)]">+1264</code> (any NANP territory that stored country code plus NPA).</li>
      <li>Validation that passed concatenated NPAs to <code class="font-mono text-sm text-[var(--ink)]">isValidCallingCode</code>.</li>
      <li>Code that expected <code class="font-mono text-sm text-[var(--ink)]">console.error</code> on a bad lookup.</li>
    </ul>

    <h3 class="mt-8 text-base font-semibold">What to change</h3>
    <CodeBlock class="mt-4" code={migrate} lang="typescript" />
    <p class="mt-4 text-[var(--muted)]">
      Show <code class="font-mono text-sm text-[var(--ink)]">dialCode</code> in a picker. Store <code class="font-mono text-sm text-[var(--ink)]">callingCode</code> when you want the E.164 country code. <code class="font-mono text-sm text-[var(--ink)]">npm install country-kit</code> still installs 1.1.0 until 2.0.0 is on npm.
    </p>

    <h3 class="mt-8 text-base font-semibold">Also in 2.0</h3>
    <ul class="mt-3 list-disc space-y-2 pl-5 text-[var(--muted)]">
      <li><code class="font-mono text-sm text-[var(--ink)]">Country</code> adds <code class="font-mono text-sm text-[var(--ink)]">commonName</code>, <code class="font-mono text-sm text-[var(--ink)]">numeric</code>, <code class="font-mono text-sm text-[var(--ink)]">callingCodes</code>, <code class="font-mono text-sm text-[var(--ink)]">dialCode</code>, UN M49 <code class="font-mono text-sm text-[var(--ink)]">region</code> / <code class="font-mono text-sm text-[var(--ink)]">subregion</code>, <code class="font-mono text-sm text-[var(--ink)]">independent</code>, IANA <code class="font-mono text-sm text-[var(--ink)]">tld</code>, <code class="font-mono text-sm text-[var(--ink)]">capital</code>, ISO 4217 <code class="font-mono text-sm text-[var(--ink)]">currencies</code>, <code class="font-mono text-sm text-[var(--ink)]">nanpAreaCodes</code>.</li>
      <li>Lookups: <code class="font-mono text-sm text-[var(--ink)]">getCountry</code> (alpha-2/3 or numeric), <code class="font-mono text-sm text-[var(--ink)]">getCountryByTld</code>, <code class="font-mono text-sm text-[var(--ink)]">getCountriesByCurrency</code>, <code class="font-mono text-sm text-[var(--ink)]">getFlagSvgUrl</code>, optional <code class="font-mono text-sm text-[var(--ink)]">country-kit/flags</code>.</li>
      <li>Kosovo (<code class="font-mono text-sm text-[var(--ink)]">XK</code>) is not included. It is user-assigned, not ISO 3166-1 assigned.</li>
    </ul>

    <h2 class="mt-12 text-xl font-semibold">1.1.0</h2>
    <p class="mt-3 text-[var(--muted)]">Published 2024-12-28.</p>
    <ul class="mt-3 list-disc space-y-2 pl-5 text-[var(--muted)]">
      <li><code class="font-mono text-sm text-[var(--ink)]">searchCountries</code>, <code class="font-mono text-sm text-[var(--ink)]">isValidCountryCode</code>, <code class="font-mono text-sm text-[var(--ink)]">isValidCallingCode</code>, <code class="font-mono text-sm text-[var(--ink)]">getCountriesByCallingCode</code>, <code class="font-mono text-sm text-[var(--ink)]">getCountriesByRegion()</code></li>
      <li>Invalid alpha-2 lookups logged with <code class="font-mono text-sm text-[var(--ink)]">console.error</code></li>
      <li>Type exports and the first docs site</li>
    </ul>

    <h2 class="mt-12 text-xl font-semibold">1.0.3</h2>
    <p class="mt-3 text-[var(--muted)]">Published 2024-12-27.</p>
    <ul class="mt-3 list-disc space-y-2 pl-5 text-[var(--muted)]">
      <li>NANP codes stored as <code class="font-mono text-sm text-[var(--ink)]">+1264</code>, not <code class="font-mono text-sm text-[var(--ink)]">+1-264</code></li>
      <li><code class="font-mono text-sm text-[var(--ink)]">getCountryFlag</code> returns <code class="font-mono text-sm text-[var(--ink)]">undefined</code> for unknown codes</li>
    </ul>

    <h2 class="mt-12 text-xl font-semibold">1.0.2</h2>
    <p class="mt-3 text-[var(--muted)]">Published 2024-12-27. Version bump only.</p>

    <h2 class="mt-12 text-xl font-semibold">1.0.1</h2>
    <p class="mt-3 text-[var(--muted)]">Published 2024-12-27. README license badge, Node and browser note, package.json fields.</p>

    <h2 class="mt-12 text-xl font-semibold">1.0.0</h2>
    <p class="mt-3 text-[var(--muted)]">
      Published 2024-12-27. First release: ISO 3166-1 alpha-2/3, names, calling codes, Unicode flags.
      <code class="font-mono text-sm text-[var(--ink)]">getCountryByCode</code>,
      <code class="font-mono text-sm text-[var(--ink)]">getCountryName</code>,
      <code class="font-mono text-sm text-[var(--ink)]">getCallingCode</code>,
      <code class="font-mono text-sm text-[var(--ink)]">getAlpha3Code</code>,
      <code class="font-mono text-sm text-[var(--ink)]">getCountryFlag</code>,
      <code class="font-mono text-sm text-[var(--ink)]">getAllCountries</code>,
      <code class="font-mono text-sm text-[var(--ink)]">getFlag</code>.
    </p>
  </section>
</Layout>
